s=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/extras/7cd2fcab029bbf33322050210df789ca.mp4?t=1791278735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >应对不同威胁的战略不胜枚举，你可以任意排列组合这些装备，既要着眼当下，也要未雨绸缪，装备无限但装备库有限，因此需要智慧选择，妥善部署。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/extras/b8e55a374dc104180e46d3d7c9663b0c.webp?t=1791278735\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在非同步多人模式——造王者（Kingmaker）中，争夺魔王遗留的王冠——你将面对终极考验，运用谋略对抗其他强大的玩家——或向好友发起实时决斗，探索世界打造你的专属配置，迎接每三天展开一次的对决，直到分出最终胜负，你还需根据未来英雄的装备和能力制定战术，寻找皇冠的下落，应对接二连三的攻击，独特的组合攻势，各种难以预测的状况——阁下又将如何脱颖而出呢？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/extras/6a98c8aac7a5cd143dcb5602b7792d5f.webp?t=1791278735\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战斗结果可能会使你站上神坛也可能会跌至谷底。每一次挑战对你来说都是进步，完成百来次挑战，你会收获新的装备，以应对接下来的挑战，即便之前的英雄无法战胜大魔王，但那些努力绝非枉然。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/extras/f23fab5c812a15f86ff129c02c2d7f52.poster.avif?t=1791278735\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/extras/f23fab5c812a15f86ff129c02c2d7f52.webm?t=1791278735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/extras/f23fab5c812a15f86ff129c02c2d7f52.mp4?t=1791278735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔王的势力增长，世界逐渐陷入混沌，死亡蔓延，槁木死灰，满目疮痍，臭气熏天。魔王将至！英雄需肩负使命，准备迎战！</p>", "short_description": "在世界某处被人遗忘的角落，暗黑势力崛起——魔王卷土重来。在这款轻肉鸽自动单机对战游戏中，动用你的智慧，寻找强大的装备，在末日中一战到底！", "supported_languages": "英语, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 捷克语, 匈牙利语, 日语, 韩语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 土耳其语, 乌克兰语, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲", "reviews": "“这款类Rogue自走棋游戏真的让人很上头，短短五分钟就可以来一场角色扮演的冒险。”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“《魔王将至》这款自走棋游戏走一个经典复古路线，集独特、神秘、战术于一身。”<br>PCGamesN<br><br>“在《魔王将至》这款类Rogue角色扮演游戏中，我看到刺猬就杀一只！”<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/13d314dc0774525c5f5353947bc4067fd30d22b6/header_schinese.jpg?t=1791278735", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/83c05a9518c62074e9fddfcac7495989204c6522/capsule_231x87_schinese.jpg?t=1791278735", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824490/83c05a9518c62074e9fddfcac7495989204c6522/capsule_184x69_schinese.jpg?t=1791278735", "website": "https://www.chronocle.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel® Core™ 2 Duo E7500 (dual-core) / AMD® Athlon™ II X2 250 (dual-core)<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 460 (1 GB) / AMD® Radeon™ HD 5830 (1 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 400 MB 可用空间</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-750 (quad-core) / AMD® Phenom™ II X4 965 (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GT 630 (2 GB) / AMD® Radeon™ HD 6670 (2 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 400 MB 可用空间</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": []